        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**FINAL VIEWING WEDNESDAY 9TH SEPTEMBER **\r\n\r\nLWK are delighted to present this superb, detached 4-bedroom bungalow in the heart of Cavan Lakelands to the market for sale.\r\n\r\nMeticulously maintained and thoughtfully enhanced, this bright and spacious property makes for an ideal family home. Located next to KiIdallagh Village, the local school, church and pub are a stone’s throw away, Belturbet and Ballyconnell are within striking distance and Cavan town is within a 15 minute drive.\r\n\r\nThe property briefly comprises a bright dual aspect living room featuring a new solid fuel stove with marble surround, complete with back burner. A modernised kitchen includes new countertops, splashback and Kitchen Island with updated kitchen units.  Patio doors then leading to the large south facing back garden . The property features a utility room, hotpress, guest WC and family bathroom plus four generous double bedrooms, to include a master bedroom en-suite. All rooms are well proportioned with ample storage. A special feature of this property is the spacious .8 acre site with immaculate wraparound lawns, complete with an insulated detached garage.\r\n\r\nThe interior and exterior of the property have been recently painted, the floors replaced with a combination of quality tiled and laminate flooring and the boiler was replaced in 2021.\r\n\r\nIdeally situated within a cluster of family homes in the countryside, the nearby towns provide a good choice of creches, schools and restaurants, with a cinema, regional hospital and a host of amenities located in Cavan town. Castle Saunderson and the highly renowned Slieve Russell Hotel with 18-hole Golf Course are close by and the Cuilcagh Boardwalk/ Stairway to Heaven is approximately 20 minutes away - to name a few.  The peaceful rural surroundings all of which combine to create a truly attractive private home.\r\n\r\nSPACIOUS 4 BED BUNGALOW IN PRISTINE  CONDITION\r\nSOUTH WEST ORIENTATION\r\nSTUNNING LAWNED  GARDENS ON.8 ACRE SITE\r\nRECENTLY PAINTED INTERIOR & EXTERIOR\r\nNEW FLOORING\r\nNEW SOLID FUEL STOVE\r\nNEW SOLID BOILER 2021\r\nOFCH\r\nBER C 2\r\nBUILT IN 2004\r\nEXTENDING TO 150 SQM/1615 SQFT\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended and is by appointment only. Please contact the agent for further details via email: annette@lwk.ie\r\n\r\n\r\n*All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases, some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have ***"
      },
